<ProseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Selected by Men handles information: no accounts, server logs, Google Analytics, and what happens when you follow an Amazon link."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy"
>
  <p>
    Selected by Men is a static recommendation site. There are no accounts, no
    comments, and no membership. This page says what we collect anyway.
  </p>
  <p>
    Operator: Selected by Men. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@selectedbymen.com">contact@selectedbymen.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <h3>Pages you visit</h3>
  <p>
    We use Google Analytics 4 (property G-M1H6F6Y6GS). Google sets cookies and
    similar identifiers and records page views, approximate location, device,
    browser, and how you arrived. We use that to see which guides are read. We
    do not use it to name you. Google’s own privacy policy governs their
    processing.
  </p>
  <h3>The host</h3>
  <p>
    The site is served through Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process IP addresses
    and security logs to run the network and stop abuse. That is their
    processing, on their terms.
  </p>
  <h3>Email</h3>
  <p>
    If you write to us, we get whatever you put in the message: your address,
    your name if you give it, and the contents. We keep that as long as we need
    it to reply or to correct a guide.
  </p>
  <h3>Theme</h3>
  <p>
    If you switch light or dark, that preference is stored in your browser
    (localStorage). It does not come to our server.
  </p>
  <h3>Amazon</h3>
  <p>
    Product links go to Amazon. If you follow one, Amazon may set cookies and
    record that the click came from this site so they can pay a commission.
    That is Amazon’s data, under <a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=468496">Amazon’s privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not sell personal information.</li>
    <li>We do not run a marketing list from this site.</li>
    <li>We do not have user accounts.</li>
    <li>We do not collect payment details. Purchases happen on Amazon.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How long</h2>
  <p>
    Analytics retention follows Google’s settings for that property. Emails
    last as long as the correspondence is useful. Server logs follow
    Cloudflare’s defaults.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can block cookies in your browser, use a tracker blocker, or write to
    the address above and ask what we have from you — which, unless you emailed
    us, is usually nothing we can tie to a name. Depending on where you live,
    you may have further rights under US state privacy laws or GDPR. Use the
    same address.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is written for adults. We do not knowingly collect information
    from children under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes in a material way, we update this page and the date
    below.
  </p>

  <p><em>Last updated August 28, 2026.</em></p>
</ProseLayout>
